{
  "caveats": [
    "Coverage is limited to the two national-road classes and expressways; it is not the length of every public road. Provincial and local-government road networks are not included as separate inventories here. National totals overlap provincial components. Precision varies in the source, including one-decimal provincial figures for 2021. Length alone does not measure traffic, road condition, lane capacity or accessibility, and the table contains no route geometry.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
  ],
